{"3882400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "救済の日", "steam_appid": 3882400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Day of Salvation&quot; is a horror game with an epic storyline of escaping from a giant humanoid creature and finding out the truth about the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The God who saved mankind has started the killing spree. Who the hell are they? ----</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/614d48ae93e30aeea1b6fc8165bacfed.poster.avif?t=1787341079\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/614d48ae93e30aeea1b6fc8165bacfed.webm?t=1787341079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/614d48ae93e30aeea1b6fc8165bacfed.mp4?t=1787341079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist enters a cold sleep to cure an incurable disease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He wakes up in a world where huge, unidentifiable humanoid creatures are attacking people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a village formed by the few survivors, the protagonist hears a shocking revelation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the hero was sleeping, the humanoid creature saved mankind and was revered as a &quot;god. ----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where did “God” come from?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did “God” save mankind once?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does “God” kill people?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure to find out the truth of the world with the survivors begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse game movies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All fully voiced movies are available for each chapter. Discover the truth of the world with diverse characters and protagonists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/dcf10bc8163dd01264434b403fbb74d0.poster.avif?t=1787341079\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/dcf10bc8163dd01264434b403fbb74d0.webm?t=1787341079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/dcf10bc8163dd01264434b403fbb74d0.mp4?t=1787341079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/f784bed57a9f93c663c839b43576791f.poster.avif?t=1787341079\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/f784bed57a9f93c663c839b43576791f.webm?t=1787341079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/f784bed57a9f93c663c839b43576791f.mp4?t=1787341079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of nine chapters will be organized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/595bc03e5c2222dc5d52efb925084767.poster.avif?t=1787341079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/595bc03e5c2222dc5d52efb925084767.webm?t=1787341079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/595bc03e5c2222dc5d52efb925084767.mp4?t=1787341079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple map configurations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character survives various maps in order to find clues to “God”. There will be 5 maps in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/cafd8f4c095facb39f0f8c74a7031cd2.poster.avif?t=1787341079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/cafd8f4c095facb39f0f8c74a7031cd2.webm?t=1787341079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/cafd8f4c095facb39f0f8c74a7031cd2.mp4?t=1787341079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invincible mode for peace of mind</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is set at a high level of difficulty and requires map exploration. However, the game has an invincibility mode in which the player is not attacked by enemies throughout the game, so even those who are anxious about the game can play it with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3882400/extras/17120cd329beb2f742622a950aba4c2e.avif?t=1787341079\" width=368 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(*Invincibility mode must be turned off to unlock achievements.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"